[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0010","text":"对了，小糸"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0020","text":"你看～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0030","text":"哇，看起来好好吃的挞……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0040","text":"是啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0050","text":"啊，不过……\n这、这里写着期间限定呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0060","text":"啊～\n只要在期间内去就没问题吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0070","text":"小糸，你什么时候能去？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0080","text":"诶……！\n我也能去吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0090","text":"嗯～？\n小糸，你不吃吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0100","text":"……但、但是\n那个……我能去吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0110","text":"……那个\n应、应该能去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0120","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0130","text":"我、我\n这周还挺忙的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0140","text":"啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0150","text":"那等小糸有空的时候\n我们一起去吃吧～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0153","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0152","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0160","text":"……咦？\n雏菜，你来了啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0170","text":"嗯～\n我来吃点零食～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0180","text":"这样啊\n……正好，先跟雏菜说一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0190","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060100_00_0200","text":"是关于下次工作的事────"}]
